description:
@Maruti_Corp @MarutiSuzuki @HDFCERGO
My WagonR met with an accident and is at Nangli Maruti Suzuki under HDFC ERGO insurance claim. Service team is saying 15-20 days for repair, which is too long. Request urgent support and resolution within 1 week.
Vehicle No: HR55BC0332====================== synopsis============= As per telephonic conversation customer said that he just took his vehicle to the workshop for insurance claim but the workshop gave the estimated time of 15-20 days hence customer is concerned as there is minor work and they are asking for 15-20 days. Moreover the insurance team giving him claim only for some parts but not the whole damaged parts hence the customer is concerning therefore please look into this matter and assist at the earliest.
